MAP: MaintenanceSector
LOC_FILE: MaintenanceSector_exploration

// 1. Exploration and Environment State Variables
VAR local bool examined_telemetry = false
VAR local bool manual_override_unlocked = false
VAR local int generator_power = 0
VAR map bool sector_lights_active = false
VAR map bool sector_airlock_open = false

// 2. Conversation Knots

=== KNOT: Main ===
CONSOLE [portrait: alert]: [STATION TELEMETRY OFFLINE] Derelict monitoring terminal idling on auxiliary reserve. Primary routing relays disconnected.
* {!examined_telemetry} [Examine maintenance telemetry and circuit status] -> ReadTelemetry
+ [<M> Scavenge surrounding debris for copper wiring (item: ScrapMetal x1)] -> ScavengeWiring
+ {!manual_override_unlocked} [<!> Force the rusted manual override lever] -> ForceLever
+ {generator_power < 2} [Insert spare capacitor into power bus (item: Capacitor x1)] -> InsertCapacitor
+ {manual_override_unlocked == true && generator_power >= 1} [Calibrate power distribution grid] -> GridCalibration
* {manual_override_unlocked == true && generator_power >= 2} [<!!> Engage airlock decompression sequence] -> DecompressAirlock
+ [Step away from the console] -> END

=== KNOT: ReadTelemetry ===
CONSOLE: Relays 4 through 9 unresponsive. Capacitor bank discharged. Manual override mechanism jammed by structural rust.
~ SET examined_telemetry = true
+ [Return to main terminal interface] -> Main

=== KNOT: ScavengeWiring ===
~ SkillCheck(Scavenge, 11)
- SUCCESS ->
    CONSOLE: Salvaged intact grounding cables and usable copper conduit from the collapsed bulkhead.
    ~ SET generator_power = 1
    -> Main
- FAILURE ->
    CONSOLE: Nothing found but corroded lead shielding and burnt silicone.
    -> Main

=== KNOT: ForceLever ===
~ SkillCheck(LiftHeavyObjects, 12)
- SUCCESS ->
    CONSOLE: Hydraulic seal breaks free with a loud metallic groan. Manual bypass engaged.
    ~ SET manual_override_unlocked = true
    -> Main
- FAILURE ->
    CONSOLE: Lever refuses to budge. Mechanism remains seized tight against the casing.
    -> Main

=== KNOT: InsertCapacitor ===
CONSOLE: Capacitor slotted into auxiliary bus. Voltage indicators flicker amber as primary conduit energizes.
~ SET generator_power = 2
~ SET sector_lights_active = true
+ [Return to main terminal interface] -> Main

=== KNOT: GridCalibration ===
~ SkillCheck(Tinker, 10)
- SUCCESS ->
    CONSOLE: Grid harmonics stabilized. Auxiliary bus humming at nominal capacity.
    ~ SET generator_power = 3
    -> Main
- FAILURE ->
    CONSOLE: Power surge trips the breaker. Frequency fluctuates wildly before resetting.
    -> Main

=== KNOT: DecompressAirlock ===
CONSOLE: Emergency klaxon blares. Pneumatic latches disengage as pressure equalizes across the quarantine corridor.
~ SET sector_airlock_open = true
+ [Disconnect from terminal] -> END
